<title>ARGENTINA: TABLE - ARGENTINA'S PEREZ FIRST HALF NET $153 MLN.</title>
<headline>TABLE - ARGENTINA'S PEREZ FIRST HALF NET $153 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>    Net		    $153 million vs $202 million</p>
<p>    EPS			 $0.18 vs $0.24</p>
<p>    ADS			 $0.36 vs $0.48</p>
<p>    Revs		   $826 million vs $700 million</p>
<p>NOTE: Perez Companc SA said net results for the first half included a $1 million corresponding to other non-operating income versus $61 million in the same period of 1996.</p>
<p>Results for the first half of 1997, without considering profits corresponding to other non-operating income show a 7.8 percent increase over those of the same period last year ($152 million versus $141 million, respectively), it added.</p>
<p>((--Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650))</p>
</text>
